Z||000000||DR650SE||12-11-2001||11:21 AM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/madgo.gif"> <BR>F*CK*N SON OF A B*TCH!!!.  I just had an accident.  Coming down a hill i slowed for a right hand turn and was going maybe 10 mph when I hit a little ice in the turn.  Still on the brakes, my tires lock up and I start going straight.  Only to hit a guy in an acura 3.2TL.(Think thats what it was.)  SO now I got another f*ck*n ticket and need to call the insurance company.  YES IT WAS IN MY D*MN FIERO!!!! AAAAARRRRGGGGGGH.  D*M*T!  I hate everything right now.  No there really wasn't any damage to my car.  THe driverside corner of the bumper is a scuffed but I can take care of that.  His car had a dent where the door meets the quarter panel.  THe dent was maybe 3-4 inches lond and about an inch or two tall.  He insisted on calling the f*cken cops(i don't blame him-who does?)  But I would have just written a check to cover costs as well as the PITA factor.  Damit!  So I think when my insurace expires, im ganna not renew and wait for another ticket to drop off my record before renewing again and will stick to a bicycle or motorcycle.  AARRGGHH!!  Then when I'm leaving the cop smiles at me and tells me "get that muffler fixed." (I don't have a muffler, just a high-flow cat and straightpipes).  Well f*ck off!  <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/brdflick.gif">   Fix it yourself b*tch, Im not fixing it I like it the way it is!  Thanks I really had to get that out, sorry If i offended anyone.  Time to call the f*cken insurance company.  <IMG SRC="http://www.stopstart.fsnet.co.uk/smilie/hanged.gif">  Damit... <BR><P>------------------<BR>AIM:  DR650SE<BR>2 Black 86 SE's V-6 4-SPD<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/DR650SEsig.gif"> ||||reg||8
