Z||000018||artherd||12-12-2001||04:11 AM||||Some ****ing ASS in a redneck truck rear-ended me in my first fiero...  We exchanged info...<P>When I took the car to a shop, we found there was over $1500 in damage! and the *******  had *DELIBRATELY* palmed the paper he wrote his address on when he gave it to me...<P>All I know is I've never seen the human waste again, and there's not a heluva lot I can do.<P>I'll call the cops next time too.<P><BR>PS: Any accident you can walk away from is a GOOD accident!  At least this didn't happen at 100mph...<P>Best!<BR>Ben.<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.cartsys.com/fiero/sig1.jpeg">    <BR>Ben Cannon<BR>88 Formula, T-top, Metalic Red           &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;"Every Man Dies, not every man really Lives"<BR>88 Formula, Northstar, Silver                    &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-Mel Gibson, "Braveheart"||||reg||3
Z||000019||DKOV||12-12-2001||12:23 PM||||I was once punted of the Freeway by a guy in a Jeep cheri-chokie.  I was in the far right lane approaching an exit and he was in the far left lane (FOUR LANES AWAY) and decided to swerve across all four lanes and hit me in the Drivers door!  We were doing a little over 60 MPH!!!<P>Took the mirror right off, that I saw at the moment of impact, then pushed me into the shoulder!  I did a few lefty-righty slides complete with hard counter steers and straightened it out only to hit a huge pile of dirt the Highway people decided to park there!<P>The car shot straight up in the air, spun a bit over 90 degrees and deposited me right back into the right lane facing the rest of traffic!!!<P>A quick steer back to the should and a couple more slides, I parked it in the ditch.<P>He did stop and gave me good and proper insurance information.  He didn't put up any fight so I didn't get screwed by him.<P>BUT... THIS is where insurance bends you over... the ADJUSTOR!!!<P>These guys are the spawn of Satan!  They will argue with you over what is and isn't broke, then call the body shop and talk them into using cheap parts, etc.!!!<P>He started by just wanting to repaint the door and replacing the driver's side mirror.  He was completely ignoring the fact that the car had just been launched like the space shuttle and landed like a bag of sand!!!<P>After some fighting, MY insurance paid for the suspension fix and went after the other company!!!  WHAT A PAIN!!!<P>Still, as stated above, any crash you walk away from is a GOOD crash.  This one could have gone MUCH worse!!!<P>DKOV -||||reg||1
