Z||000021||loafer87gt||12-12-2001||03:46 PM||||My first accident happened when some drunked a-hole pulled a u-ball right in front of me and I tboned the front of his car. This happened in small home town. Well, I called the cops, and about an hour later they arrived and the kid was starting to sober up, but was still in no shape to drive. The cop takes him down to the station and comes back another hour later, and says no charges are being pressed. A couple of weeks later I saw the dumba$$ at a bushparty and he said he blew over, but the cop let him go because he ratted out the guys who broke into the police station. My only satisfaction is ratting him out to the guys he ratted out and watching him get the living $hit get kicked out him. Still kinda ticks me off tho that I had to pay my deductable.||||reg||1
